# Local static UI + Next build: `set -a && source .env.autopulse && set +a` before `npm run build`.
#
# DuckDB: optional `AUTOPULSE_DATA_DIR` / `AUTOPULSE_PROJECT_ROOT` pins the root used to resolve
# relative `AUTOPULSE_DUCKDB_PATH` (defaults to monorepo checkout root, not process cwd).
#
# Standalone backend serves the dashboard API at same-origin ``/dashboard/...`` and ``/ingest``.
# Use an origin-only base for sidecar dev (Next on :3000), or leave unset for static UI on :8000.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTOPULSE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# AUTOPULSE_API_KEY=ap_live_…
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTOPULSE_API_KEY=ap_live_…
